    "protected": false,
    "rendered": "<div class=\"xyz-content\">\n<nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"shell pt-6\">\n<ol class=\"m-0 flex list-none flex-wrap items-center gap-2 p-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">  <a href=\"/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Home </a> </li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <a href=\"/services/\" class=\"no-underline hover:underline\"> Services </a> </li>\n<li class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"> <span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"text-rule\"> / </span> <span aria-current=\"page\">ABN application</span> </li>\n</ol>\n</nav>\n<div class=\"shell pt-6\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Services</p>\n<h1 class=\"mt-3 max-w-3xl text-3xl sm:text-4xl\">ABN application</h1>\n<p class=\"mt-4 max-w-2xl text-[1.0625rem]\">An ABN is free to apply for yourself at abr.gov.au and takes about fifteen minutes. What is worth paying for is the question underneath it: whether you are actually carrying on a business, and what structure you should hold the ABN in.</p>\n</p></div>\n<section class=\"shell mt-10\">\n<div class=\"grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-3\">\n<div class=\"card p-5\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Our fee</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0\"> <span class=\"font-mono tabular-nums tracking-tight text-ink text-2xl font-medium\">$99</span> <span class=\"ml-2 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">fixed, inc. GST</span> </p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\"> Fixed, agreed in writing, no work begins before you accept it. </p>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"card p-5\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Government charges</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[1.0625rem] font-semibold\"> None </p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\"> This registration is free. You pay us for the advice, not the typing. </p>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"card p-5\">\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Who does it</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[1.0625rem] font-semibold\">A registered tax agent</p>\n<p class=\"mt-1 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\"> BRS Advisory Pty Ltd, Registered Tax Agent, CPA Australia Public Practice. <a href=\"/identity-verification/\">Every client ID-verified</a> before work starts. </p>\n</p></div>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-16\">\n<div class=\"grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr]\">\n<div>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl\">What&#8217;s included</h2>\n<ul class=\"mt-5 list-none border-t border-rule p-0\">\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">An honest answer on whether you are carrying on an enterprise at all</li>\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">The right entity: sole trader, partnership, company or trust</li>\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">The ABN application lodged and followed up if the ABR asks questions</li>\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">GST registration at the same time if you need it</li>\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">Business name registration if you are trading under something else</li>\n<li class=\"border-b border-rule py-3 text-[0.9375rem]\">What your ABN obligations actually are once you have one</li>\n</ul></div>\n<div>\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl\">How it runs</h2>\n<ol class=\"mt-5 list-none border-t border-rule p-0\">\n<li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 01 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">Verify your identity online — about three minutes on your phone, included in the fee. Every client, every service, no exceptions. <a href=\"/identity-verification/\">How it works</a>.</span> </li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 02 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">Tell us what you are doing and how you are being paid.</span> </li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 03 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">We tell you whether you need an ABN — sometimes the answer is no, and that is a free answer.</span> </li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 04 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">If you do, we lodge the application in the right entity and deal with any ABR follow-up.</span> </li>\n<li class=\"flex gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\"> <span class=\"font-mono text-[0.75rem] tabular-nums text-ink-soft\"> 05 </span> <span class=\"text-[0.9375rem]\">You get the ABN and a short note on what you now have to do at tax time.</span> </li>\n</ol></div>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-16\">\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl\">Start it</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-6 max-w-2xl text-[0.9375rem]\"> Tell us what you need and we will come back with a fixed fee and what we need from you. No obligation, and no charge for telling you that you don&#8217;t need this. </p>\n<div class=\"card overflow-hidden p-2 sm:p-4\"> <iframe id=\"JotFormIFrame-263233744220045\" src=\"https://form.jotform.com/263233744220045\" title=\"ABN application — enquiry form for XYZ Accounting\" class=\"block w-full border-0\" style=\"height:52rem;min-height:52rem\" scrolling=\"no\" allow=\"geolocation; microphone; camera; fullscreen; payment\"></iframe><script src=\"https://cdn.jotfor.ms/s/umd/latest/for-form-embed-handler.js\"></script><script>window.jotformEmbedHandler(\"iframe[id='JotFormIFrame-263233744220045']\", \"https://form.jotform.com/\")</script> </div>\n<p class=\"mt-3 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\"> Form not loading? <a href=\"https://form.jotform.com/263233744220045\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Open it in a new tab</a>, or call 0407 179 179 and we will take the details over the phone. Please don&#8217;t include your tax file number either way — we ask for it securely once an accountant is working on your file. </p>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-16\">\n<h2 class=\"text-xl\">Work the numbers first</h2>\n<ul class=\"mt-5 grid list-none gap-px border border-rule bg-rule p-0 sm:grid-cols-2\">\n<li class=\"bg-white p-5\">\n<h3 class=\"text-base\"> <a href=\"/calculators/sole-trader-tax-calculator/\" class=\"text-ink no-underline hover:underline\"> Sole trader </a> </h3>\n<p class=\"mt-2 mb-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Tax on your business profit, plus what to put aside for GST and the next PAYG instalment.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-12\">\n<div class=\"card p-6\">\n<h2 class=\"text-lg\">Other services</h2>\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex flex-wrap gap-3\"> <a href=\"/services/company-registration/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\"> Company setup </a><a href=\"/services/gst-registration/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\"> GST registration </a><a href=\"/services/bookkeeping/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\"> Bookkeeping </a><a href=\"/services/trust-setup/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\"> Trust setup </a><a href=\"/services/partnership-setup/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\"> Partnership setup </a><a href=\"/services/smsf/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\"> Self-managed super fund </a> <a href=\"/services/\" class=\"btn btn-secondary text-sm\">All services</a> </div>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"shell mt-20\">\n<div class=\"card p-6 sm:p-8\">\n<div class=\"grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr] md:gap-12\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"eyebrow m-0\">Registered tax agent</p>\n<h2 class=\"mt-2 text-2xl\">A real practice, not a form that emails you a PDF</h2>\n<p class=\"mt-3 max-w-lg text-[0.9375rem]\"> Every return is prepared and reviewed by a registered agent before it is lodged. Because we lodge on your behalf, you get the agent deadline rather than the 31 October one — that is roughly six extra months, and it is the single most common reason people switch. </p>\n<p> <a href=\"/about/\" class=\"mt-4 inline-block text-sm\">Meet the accountant →</a> </div>\n<dl class=\"m-0 border-t border-rule\">\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\">\n<dt class=\"m-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Registration</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 text-sm font-medium text-ink\">Registered Tax Agent</dd>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\">\n<dt class=\"m-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Agent lodgement deadline</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 font-mono text-sm font-medium tabular-nums text-ink\">15 May 2027</dd>\n</p></div>\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 border-b border-rule py-3\">\n<dt class=\"m-0 text-[0.8125rem] text-ink-soft\">Lodging yourself</dt>\n<dd class=\"m-0 font-mono text-sm font-medium tabular-nums text-ink\">31 October 2026</dd>\n</p></div>\n</dl></div>\n</p></div>\n</section>\n</div>\n<div hidden class=\"xyz-schema\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Service\",\"@id\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/services/abn-application/#service\",\"name\":\"ABN application\",\"url\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/services/abn-application/\",\"description\":\"Applying for an ABN is free and takes 15 minutes. What's worth paying for is the question underneath: are you carrying on a business, and in what structure?\",\"provider\":{\"@id\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/#organization\"},\"areaServed\":{\"@type\":\"Country\",\"name\":\"Australia\"}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"@id\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/#organization\",\"name\":\"XYZ Accounting\",\"url\":\"https://superblyladyec52fb18e8-stxdq.wpcomstaging.com/\"}</script></div>\n"
